From a1731bf5ababef64222f523e635c8c8276b54c22 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Zhen XIN <lone.zen6@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 21 Aug 2026 20:04:10 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 02/14] block: add loop-AES and LY68 PSRAM support

Restore the custom encrypted loop-device implementation using the maintained loop-AES 3.8i Linux 6.x sources, and add the Lyontek LY68 block driver used by the target boards.

Co-authored-by: Copilot <223556219+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>
